{"id":"wb-5-205","name":"十方普觉寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"十方普觉寺","text":"十方普觉寺位于北京市海淀区寿安山南麓，国家植物园内，因寺中卧佛殿供有卧佛铜像而俗称“卧佛寺”。2001年6月25日被中华人民共和国国务院批准列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位名单。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E6%96%B9%E6%99%AE%E8%A7%89%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":84928167,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84928167","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/11fbbf64b7952a9625629caf.jpg","title":"The_Gate_of_Wofo_Temple_in_Haidian_District2022.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Gate_of_Wofo_Temple_in_Haidian_District2022.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/The_Gate_of_Wofo_Temple_in_Haidian_District2022.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Charlie fong","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​位于海淀香山植物园内的北京十方普觉寺入口处，2022年春节期间拍摄。","width":320,"height":320}}